  "html": "<div class=\"testi-carousel-head\">\n  <h2>Hear It From <span>Our Students</span></h2>\n  <p>500+ reviews. 4.9 out of 5. Here's what a few of them said.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"testi-carousel\">\n  <input type=\"radio\" name=\"testiSlide\" id=\"testi-r0\" class=\"testi-radio\" checked>\n  <input type=\"radio\" name=\"testiSlide\" id=\"testi-r1\" class=\"testi-radio\">\n  <input type=\"radio\" name=\"testiSlide\" id=\"testi-r2\" class=\"testi-radio\">\n\n  <div class=\"testi-carousel-body\">\n    <div class=\"testi-carousel-image\">\n      <img src=\"assets/testimonial.png\" alt=\"Lime Digital Institute student success stories\" class=\"testi-static-img\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"testi-carousel-cards\">\n      <div class=\"testi-card\" data-slide=\"0\">\n        <div class=\"testi-card-top\">\n          <span class=\"testi-tag\">Founder Story &middot; Export Brand</span>\n          <svg class=\"testi-quote-icon\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.583 17.321C3.553 16.227 3 15 3 13.011c0-3.5 2.457-6.637 6.03-8.188l.893 1.378c-3.324 1.202-4.59 3.013-4.823 4.887.653-.306 1.411-.444 2.213-.444 2.41 0 4.187 1.613 4.187 3.867 0 2.42-1.92 4.17-4.35 4.17-1.02 0-1.983-.414-2.567-1.361zm11 0C14.553 16.227 14 15 14 13.011c0-3.5 2.457-6.637 6.03-8.188l.893 1.378c-3.324 1.202-4.59 3.013-4.823 4.887.653-.306 1.411-.444 2.213-.444 2.41 0 4.187 1.613 4.187 3.867 0 2.42-1.92 4.17-4.35 4.17-1.02 0-1.983-.414-2.567-1.361z\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"testi-headline\">&ldquo;I didn't have a business plan &ndash; I had a skill I learned in this classroom.&rdquo;</h3>\n        <p class=\"testi-story\">I joined to learn digital marketing and ended up building a global business. I now run <strong>Dhritiva</strong>, exporting incense sticks and essential oils to worldwide markets.</p>\n        <div class=\"testi-result-badge\"><span class=\"testi-result-dot\"></span><span>Result: Exporting to International Markets</span></div>\n        <div class=\"testi-profile\">\n          <img src=\"assets/student-drashti.jpg\" alt=\"Patel Drashti\" class=\"testi-avatar\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\">\n          <div class=\"testi-info\">\n            <strong class=\"testi-name\">Patel Drashti</strong>\n            <span class=\"testi-company\">Founder &ndash; Dhritiva</span>\n            <span class=\"testi-meta\">1st Student of Lime Digital Institute</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"testi-card\" data-slide=\"1\">\n        <div class=\"testi-card-top\">\n          <span class=\"testi-tag\">B2B Transformation</span>\n          <svg class=\"testi-quote-icon\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.583 17.321C3.553 16.227 3 15 3 13.011c0-3.5 2.457-6.637 6.03-8.188l.893 1.378c-3.324 1.202-4.59 3.013-4.823 4.887.653-.306 1.411-.444 2.213-.444 2.41 0 4.187 1.613 4.187 3.867 0 2.42-1.92 4.17-4.35 4.17-1.02 0-1.983-.414-2.567-1.361zm11 0C14.553 16.227 14 15 14 13.011c0-3.5 2.457-6.637 6.03-8.188l.893 1.378c-3.324 1.202-4.59 3.013-4.823 4.887.653-.306 1.411-.444 2.213-.444 2.41 0 4.187 1.613 4.187 3.867 0 2.42-1.92 4.17-4.35 4.17-1.02 0-1.983-.414-2.567-1.361z\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"testi-headline\">&ldquo;Don't sell your product. Solve your farmer's problem. We rebuilt Polygen around that.&rdquo;</h3>\n        <p class=\"testi-story\">I run an agrichem company. Nobody thought we belonged on social media &ndash; not even me. Paras Sir guided our positioning, and we transformed <strong>Polygen</strong>'s entire digital presence into a customer engine.</p>\n        <div class=\"testi-result-badge\"><span class=\"testi-result-dot\"></span><span>Result: Complete B2B Digital Overhaul</span></div>\n        <div class=\"testi-profile\">\n          <img src=\"assets/student-vedang.png\" alt=\"Vedang Pedhadiya\" class=\"testi-avatar\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\">\n          <div class=\"testi-info\">\n            <strong class=\"testi-name\">Vedang Pedhadiya</strong>\n            <span class=\"testi-company\">Co-Founder &ndash; Polygen</span>\n            <span class=\"testi-meta\">Agrichemical Manufacturer</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"testi-card\" data-slide=\"2\">\n        <div class=\"testi-card-top\">\n          <span class=\"testi-tag\">Professional To Founder</span>\n          <svg class=\"testi-quote-icon\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.583 17.321C3.553 16.227 3 15 3 13.011c0-3.5 2.457-6.637 6.03-8.188l.893 1.378c-3.324 1.202-4.59 3.013-4.823 4.887.653-.306 1.411-.444 2.213-.444 2.41 0 4.187 1.613 4.187 3.867 0 2.42-1.92 4.17-4.35 4.17-1.02 0-1.983-.414-2.567-1.361zm11 0C14.553 16.227 14 15 14 13.011c0-3.5 2.457-6.637 6.03-8.188l.893 1.378c-3.324 1.202-4.59 3.013-4.823 4.887.653-.306 1.411-.444 2.213-.444 2.41 0 4.187 1.613 4.187 3.867 0 2.42-1.92 4.17-4.35 4.17-1.02 0-1.983-.414-2.567-1.361z\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"testi-headline\">&ldquo;Rivanta Naturals didn't exist before this course &ndash; now it does.&rdquo;</h3>\n        <p class=\"testi-story\">Working full-time, my only window was 8 AM to 9 AM. Paras Sir built a focused morning batch around people like me. In that one hour daily, I got real business insights and launched <strong>Rivanta Naturals</strong>.</p>\n        <div class=\"testi-result-badge\"><span class=\"testi-result-dot\"></span><span>Result: Built Brand from Morning Batch</span></div>\n        <div class=\"testi-profile\">\n          <img src=\"assets/student-jignesh.png\" alt=\"Prapati Jignesh\" class=\"testi-avatar\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\">\n          <div class=\"testi-info\">\n            <strong class=\"testi-name\">Prapati Jignesh</strong>\n            <span class=\"testi-company\">Founder &ndash; Rivanta Naturals</span>\n            <span class=\"testi-meta\">Executive Morning Batch</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"testi-dots\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"testi-dot\" data-dot=\"0\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('testi-r0').checked=true\" aria-label=\"Story 1\"></button>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"testi-dot\" data-dot=\"1\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('testi-r1').checked=true\" aria-label=\"Story 2\"></button>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"testi-dot\" data-dot=\"2\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('testi-r2').checked=true\" aria-label=\"Story 3\"></button>\n    </div>\n\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"testi-arrow testi-arrow-prev\" onclick=\"testiNav(-1)\" aria-label=\"Previous story\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"15 18 9 12 15 6\"></polyline></svg></button>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"testi-arrow testi-arrow-next\" onclick=\"testiNav(1)\" aria-label=\"Next story\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"9 18 15 12 9 6\"></polyline></svg></button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"
